ic dependencies from content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md and builds prerequisite graph", "Output: HTML5 interactive flowchart (mermaid/D3); JSON prerequisite DAG (directed acyclic graph) with no cycles", "Each path must start at foundational topics; circular dependencies flagged as errors with exit code 1"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Equipment Certification and Maintenance Scheduler Generator", "priority": "medium", "description": "Auto-generates maintenance schedules, certification checklists, and equipment tracking templates for all hardware/tools mentioned in CoCu files. Creates compliance documentation for equipment validation.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_equipment_maintenance.py extracts all equipment from content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md and generates Excel template with columns: equipment_name, manufacturer, model, certification_required, maintenance_frequency, last_certified", "Output: Excel file (output/NOSS-equipment-maintenance-schedule.xlsx); JSON equipment registry (output/equipment_registry.json) with 40+ items", "Includes maintenance log templates; certification deadline tracking; compliance status indicators"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Peer Assessment Rubric Generator for Group Activities", "priority": "medium", "description": "Generates peer-review rubrics (4-point scale: Novice/Developing/Proficient/Advanced) for all group activities and practical exercises. Enables learner-to-learner assessment aligned with NOSS competency framework.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_peer_assessment_rubrics.py creates rubrics for all 60+ practical exercises from content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md", "Output: PDF rubric templates (output/peer_rubrics_*.pdf); JSON structured rubrics with scoring guides; descriptors for each proficiency level", "Each rubric maps to learning outcomes; includes evidence of competency indicators; exportable to assessment platforms"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Competency Badge and Digital Credential System Metadata", "priority": "medium", "description": "Designs and generates metadata for digital competency badges using OpenBadges standard. Enables issuing cryptographically-verifiable credentials for demonstrated competencies on block chain-ready platforms.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_badge_metadata.py creates badge definitions for all 80+ competencies extracted from work activities", "Output: JSON metadata files conforming to OpenBadges v3 spec (output/badges/*.json); SVG badge graphics (output/badges/graphics/); issuer metadata (output/issuer.json)", "Each badge includes: competency_id, mastery_level, issuing_criteria, alignment to learning outcomes; can be imported to Badgr/Mozilla Backpack"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Real-Time Instructor Progress Tracking Dashboard Generator", "priority": "high", "description": "Creates interactive HTML5 dashboard for instructors to monitor learner progress, identify gaps, and access remediation recommendations. Aggregates competency achievement data with visual analytics.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_instructor_dashboard.py builds single-page HTML5 app (output/instructor_dashboard.html) with interactive charts using Chart.js/D3", "Dashboard displays: cohort performance metrics by competency, individual learner mastery levels, gap analysis (competencies <80% pass rate), remediation recommendations per gap", "Accepts JSON input (output/instructor_data_schema.json) defining data structure for real learner performance data integration"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Bilingual Video Subtitle and Transcript Template Generator", "priority": "medium", "description": "Creates template system for generating video captions, transcripts, and timing guides (English + Bahasa Malaysia). Supports instructors in developing video content with accessibility compliance.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_subtitle_templates.py extracts learning outcomes and key concepts from content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md, generates timing guides", "Output: .srt subtitle template files (output/subtitles/*.srt) with bilingual placeholders; JSON transcript schemas; time allocation guides (e.g., 'Introduction 0:00-2:30')", "Templates include Bahasa Malaysia translations of key terminology sourced from bilingual glossary; ready for instructor custom recording"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Industry Expert Review and Validation Framework Generator", "priority": "high", "description": "Generates structured review process, checklists, and feedback collection schemas for industry experts to validate technical accuracy, currency, and workplace relevance of all CoCu content.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/generate_expert_review_framework.py creates review checklist (output/expert_review_checklist.pdf) covering: technical accuracy, technology currency (2024-2026), safety compliance, industry standards alignment, workplace relevance", "Output: PDF review guide; JSON feedback schema (output/expert_feedback_schema.json) exportable to Google Forms; rubric for scoring review responses", "Generates unique review tokens for each CoCu unit (20 tokens); tracks reviewer identity, review date, findings; produces compliance report"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}, {"title": "Content Update Audit Trail and Compliance Impact Analyzer", "priority": "high", "description": "Analyzes git history to track all changes to CoCu files and assesses compliance impact. Generates audit trail showing which changes affected NOSS compliance, assessment criteria, or learning outcomes.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script scripts/audit_content_changes.py runs git log on content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md, parses diffs for compliance-related changes (keywords: 'assessment', 'contact hour', 'outcome', 'NOSS', 'learning')", "Output: JSON changelog (output/content_audit_trail.json) with columns: timestamp, file, change_summary, impact_rating (critical/high/medium/low), commit_hash, author", "Flags all changes affecting NOSS structure, assessment criteria, or learning outcomes with 'compliance_change': true; generates impact summary report (output/audit_report.html)"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "spiral-backlog-us071"}]}
